types.doc:
Supplier EPS data, separate from a display material. Null means unknown.
Declared compression strength includes the strain at which it was measured;
it is not automatically an allowable stress for dimensional control.

Checks insert-to-datum location. Bed pins locate the datum, never the insert.
Rectangular subsets outside conservative hole/cut bounds certify contact witnesses;
they do not approximate a drilled solid or infer a press fit from a clearance screw.

Exact planning queries. Orthogonal expressions retain the shared box algebra;
other expressions require the application's exact kernel. Stock bounds never
enter material moments or interior-overlap decisions.

Nominal jig relationships. Angular limits retain the source reference span;
coplanarity/distance use conservative bounds over the recorded finite stock.
These are design prerequisites, never flatness traces or measured qualification.

Native references are reproducible from the report's bound source plan.
The component key selects the exact connected solid above the sealing plane;
a native region never supplies an invented array of boxes.
